<p>Cuba said it is prepared for the unlikely possibility of a US military attack after President Trump again spoke about “taking” the island, even as Havana kept a diplomatic channel open with Washington. Cuban Deputy Foreign Minister Carlos Fernandez de Cossio said the country has long been ready to mobilize against external aggression and cannot afford to be naive, though he added that such an attack would have no justification. The comments came as Cuba struggles with a severe energy and economic crisis that reports link to a US oil blockade imposed in January. Earlier this month, Havana and Washington began talks aimed at easing tensions.</p><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>No regime deal: Fernandez de Cossio said any proposal involving an “off-ramp” for Cuban President Miguel Diaz-Canel or negotiations over the structure of Cuba’s government is “absolutely” not part of the talks with Washington.</li><li>Blackout backdrop: The warning came as Cuba emerged from another blackout, underscoring how deeply the fuel crisis is shaping the moment.</li></ul><blockquote>We don’t believe it is something that is probable, but we would be naive if we do not prepare - Carlos Fernandez de Cossio</blockquote><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Cuban diplomacy: A Cuban diplomat said Havana has “no quarrel” with Washington and is still ready to keep talking despite the military rhetoric. (<a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/cuba-readies-for-possible-us-attack-but-ready-to-talk-diplomat'>The Straits Times</a>)</li><li>US president: Trump sharpened his rhetoric by saying he expected to have the “honour” of taking Cuba, helping prompt Havana’s public response. (<a href='https://michaelwest.com.au/cuba-is-ready-for-any-potential-attack-from-us-envoy/'>Michael West</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.rt.com/news/635878-cuba-ready-for-us-invasion/'>Cuba ready for possible US invasion – deputy foreign minister</a> - rt.com</li><li><a href='https://michaelwest.com.au/cuba-is-ready-for-any-potential-attack-from-us-envoy/'>Cuba is ready for any potential attack from US: envoy</a> - michaelwest.com.au</li><li><a href='https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/3/22/emerging-from-latest-blackout-cuba-says-ready-for-any-potential-us-attack'>Emerging from latest blackout, Cuba says ready for any potential US attack</a> - aljazeera.com</li><li><a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/world/americas/article/3347511/cuba-ready-potential-attack-us-amid-oil-blockade-deputy-foreign-minister'>Cuba says ready for potential US attack as it recovers from latest blackout</a> - scmp.com</li><li><a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/cuba-readies-for-possible-us-attack-but-ready-to-talk-diplomat'>Cuba readies for possible US attack, but ready to talk: Diplomat</a> - straitstimes.com</li></ul>